        "content": "<p>alexcrichton opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14584\">issue #14584</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Shared memories are disabled by default in Wasmtime, but if enabled then the following test doesn't pass. Note that the <code>wast</code> subcommand <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/blob/4d953159b9e29779cbaf7df0d183f0c44a7c8099/src/commands/wast.rs#L59\">unconditionally enables shared memory</a> for spec tests.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"wasm\"><pre><span></span><code>(module $a\n  (memory (export \"m\") 1 1 shared)\n  (func (export \"ld\") (param i32) (result i32) (i32.load (local.get 0))))\n(register \"a\" $a)\n(module $b (import \"a\" \"m\" (memory 1 1 shared)))\n(assert_trap (invoke $a \"ld\" (i32.const 0x10000)) \"out of bounds\")\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"cp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wast</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">shared_fault</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wast</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">thread</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">'</span><span class=\"na\">main</span><span class=\"o\">'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1152921</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">panicked</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">crates</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">src</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">runtime</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">rs</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">2031</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">17</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"nc\">assertion</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">failed</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">fault</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_none</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"n\">note</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">`</span><span class=\"n\">RUST_BACKTRACE</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"err\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">environment</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">display</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">backtrace</span>\n<span class=\"n\">zsh</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">IOT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instruction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dumped</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">wasmtime</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wast</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">shared_fault</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wast</span>\n</code></pre></div><br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
